<div class="side-by-side">
  <h2>The Challenge</h2>
  <p>
    Intel Inspires is one of the largest scholastic esports events. It runs an eight-month tournament series that ends in a live championship, so it needed one identity that matched its scale. The event also had to produce brand engagement, career development and leads for Intel and its partners.
  </p>
</div>

