<h2>The Solution</h2>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">A Unified Identity for Scholastic Esports</p>
  <p>
    From social promos to event signage, we adapted Intel's corporate branding into an esports identity. It is modular enough to include partner brands like ASUS, CDW and SHI, and the design system stays consistent on screens of all sizes.
  </p>
</div>
<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">A Structured Path for Players</p>
  <p>
    We built Intel Inspires as a structured path for high school and college players to compete, network and gain visibility. The summit featured top talent and gave students a chance to learn from and meet industry professionals and recruiters.
  </p>
</div>
<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">Competition & Career Development</p>
  <p>
    The three-day LAN championship and industry summit combined esports matches with panels and networking sessions, so players and educators could leave with useful insights and career contacts.
  </p>
</div>
