<div>
  <h2>The Impact</h2>
  <p>
    More than 10,000 students from 478 schools took part, competing for $30K
    in grants. The program earned 2.7M+ social impressions across Intel and
    partner channels, and the 223 educators who attended generated 403 leads
    for partner brands.
  </p>
</div>
